#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/hr_payroll/static/src/components/payslip_action_helper/payslip_action_helper.xml:0
msgid ""
"The Payslip is the computation of the pay based on a period of time for an "
"employee.\n"
"                        It computes the Net salary according to the Salary "
"Rules you've defined in the configuration."
msgstr ""
"ໃບຈ່າຍເງິນແມ່ນການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າຈ້າງຕາມໄລຍະເວລາສຳລັບພະນັກງານ.\n"
"                        ມັນຈະຄິດໄລ່ເງິນເດືອນສຸດທິ ຕາມກົດລະບຽບເງິນເດືອນທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນການ"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. module: hr_payroll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_payroll.field_hr_work_entry_type__is_unforeseen
msgid ""
"The Work Entry checked as Unforeseen Absence will be counted in absenteeism "
"at work report."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຖືກກວດສອບວ່າເປັນ ການຂາດວຽກທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄາດຄິດ "
"ຈະຖືກນັບເຂົ້າໃນການຂາດວຽກໃນລາຍງານການເຮັດວຽກ."

#. module: hr_payroll
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll/models/res_company.py:0
msgid ""
"The YTD reset day must be a valid day of the month : since the current month "
